@TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209

### 1. Etkinlik Oluştur (Create Event)
POST {{TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Yaz Konseri 2026",
  "location": "Harbiye Cemil Topuzlu Açıkhava Tiyatrosu",
  "startDate": "2026-08-15T20:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-08-15T23:30:00Z"
}

### 2. Tüm Etkinlikleri Getir (Get All Events)
GET {{TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### 3. Id ile Etkinlik Getir (Get Event by Id)
GET {{TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 4. Id ile Bilet Getir (Get Ticket by Id)
GET {{TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 5. Bilet Rezerve Et (Reserve Ticket)
POST {{TicketingApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reserve
Accept: application/json
